WEBVTT

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:14.600
It looks like we've arrived in
a different place again.

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.550
I wonder if there is more of
Wonderland above this station too?

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:21.880
Are you scared, Yu?

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:25.250
I'm not scared of any place anymore.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:31.620
At any rate, one by one, we've got to be sure
to look around all of these stations we arrive at.

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:37.260
If your parents really used this Subway,
then we're sure to find them eventually.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:39.200
You're right.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.390
That's true.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:45.340
That reminds me, have you thought
of a name for this little guy?

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:47.100
Yeah, Chobi!

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:50.040
What a weird name!

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.510
Are you sure?

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:53.480
Yes, it's way too weird!

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:23.170
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:23.170
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:30.680
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:30.680
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:39.790
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:39.790
With our eyes on the future

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:45.890
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:45.890
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:55.530
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:55.530
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:01:57.410 --> 00:02:03.040
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:01:57.410 --> 00:02:03.040
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:08.750
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:08.750
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:18.260
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:18.260
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:28.230
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:31.040
I can see many different kinds of faces.

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:34.410
The face that will never give up hope...

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.950
The face disappointed with farewells...

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:40.120
The face that loves machinery...

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:43.250
The face of a destroyer...

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:46.290
The face of those escaping...

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:49.520
The face of exploding anger...

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.290
The face of the revived...

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:56.830
The face of a trembling heart...

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:02.080
I am Fabula.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.300
This is the kind of face I have.

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:06.610
The face that reads nature.

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:15.220
It's hot!

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.060
They're not here!

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:26.090
There's no way Mom and Dad would be in a
desert like this with flames shooting up!

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:27.890
I guess you're right.

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:31.070
I can't feel the spirits of any humans here.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:37.740
The entrance to the Subway just disappeared!

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:40.080
This is horrible!

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:41.850
Oh, no!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:44.710
I hate this!

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.010
We've got no choice but to dig!

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:48.320
This spirit...

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:51.020
Chobi, help us out!

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:52.520
Watch out!

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.710
I can't go any further. Let's take a break.

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:17.540
If we rest now, we'll only succeed
in letting the heat wear us down.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.450
You've got to hang in there
until we find a safe place.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:21.610
Okay, Ai?

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:23.680
Sis!

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:27.960
So you're saying you don't care if we
never see your parents again?

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:31.290
Well, then go for it.

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:35.760
It seems you're the one who
wants to find them so bad.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.150
Earthworm tomatoes chopped into large pieces

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:53.880
and cooked together with ground
chocobo meat and shilkiss leaves.

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:57.450
It is a mouton style soup, Your Excellency.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.430
What's going on?

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:03.290
Does it not suit your taste?

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:07.100
I'm talking about Makenshi!
Where has he gone off to?!

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:08.830
I'm not sure.

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:15.670
Somebody hurry up and put an end
to the Black Wind!

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:20.410
Right now, right now, right now,
right now, right now!

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:20.410
Leave it to me to take care of the Magun man.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:27.590
Soon I will return to my original size,

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.680
and then I will be sure to...

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:34.400
Wait until then.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.890
Is that what you're telling me to do?

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:45.900
Your Excellency...

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.330
What do you want, Herba?

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:51.440
I'll go out and check on how
my Magun baby is doing,

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:53.640
so please get back in a better mood.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.240
Herba! This is none of your business,
don't you dare get involved!

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:07.250
Oscha, go ahead and bring
His Excellency a new plate.

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:10.760
If you don't, I'll have to Hughug you.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:14.900
Yes, Ma'am.

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:21.270
Chobi, I'll let you have some of my water.

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.870
Wait, Yu, you mustn't give that to him.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.410
But he said that he's so thirsty
he thinks he's going to die.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:31.850
Yeah, we haven't even given him one sip.

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:34.880
Chobi is an animal, isn't he?

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:38.430
Hey, now you're talking like
some kind of animal abuser!

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:39.820
Lisa...

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:47.760
He said he could smell water.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:48.930
Really?

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.090
Wait up, Chobi!

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.340
Oh, it's so cold.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:05.210
I'm so glad Chobi led us to a source of water.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.450
Is that why you didn't want
to give him any water?

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:10.960
Lisa, you sure do know a lot about
a lot of different things.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.250
I'll get you!

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:18.520
Hey, you guys cut it out.

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:31.870
Isn't it beautiful?

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:41.620
But I think I'm going to be wanting
a new one very soon.

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:44.390
If I want a beautiful flower to bloom,

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:47.460
I've got to be sure to give
Hughug a good feeding.

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:54.270
Did you see the Magun baby?

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:59.400
You still haven't found him?!
That's no good.

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:01.410
Oh, this is so boring.

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:11.010
Oh, my...

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:16.820
One of the Earl's henchmen?!

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:17.950
Lisa!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.080
Ai! Yu!

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:47.380
Let's run for it!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.570
Lisa, what are you doing?!

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:07.470
We've got to hurry up and run!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:18.050
Wow...

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:19.780
She blew them away.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:24.680
Ai! Yu!

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.360
What do we do now?!

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:32.890
Let's jump!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.430
No way!

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:36.900
But the monsters are coming!

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.240
Ai! Yu!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:50.640
I must protect them at all costs.

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:54.050
It's for times like this that I trained so hard.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.660
<i>If you spill any water, you've got
to start over from the beginning.</i>

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:26.520
She's not human!

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:48.740
What are you going to do?

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:50.510
You want to know?

00:10:50.610 --> 00:10:53.310
You're going to find out what
it means to get a Hughug.

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:55.440
What are you talking about?

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:57.850
What a great meal you're going to make!

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:01.020
Eating you will definitely make my Hughug baby
bloom beautiful flowers.

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:07.380
Sis, help Lisa!

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.460
Hey, are you trying to bring me into this?

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:11.890
You can't get anything out
of Poshepocket to help?

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.760
Oh yeah, that's right! Let me try.

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:17.500
Don't talk so loud.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:21.900
Listen carefully, I want something
we can use to help Lisa.

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:28.810
Hey, hold on! Stop it!

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:33.850
You're not helping at all, you useless idiot!

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.050
Watch it!

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:47.330
Ai! Yu!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.400
Oh, my...

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:55.440
This is bad!

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:57.530
Stop it! Just leave those kids alone.

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:04.320
<i>You'll never be able to read the
spirits of nature like that, Lisa.</i>

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:10.010
<i>Let go of your heart. Feel the nature around you.</i>

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:14.290
<i>Allow your body to only do what those
who can read the spirit can do.</i>

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:17.420
<i>That is the Kigen Arts.</i>

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:34.340
What the...

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:36.150
Lisa!

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:44.350
Sorry, we...

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:46.980
Don't worry about it, hurry up.

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:48.360
This is no good.

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.120
You guys are quite the misbehavers.

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:54.470
You really think you can get away?

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:57.270
They've surrounded us!

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:59.270
Take care of them, Lisa!

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:00.840
There's too many of them.

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:03.000
Hey, Houzukisuki babies,

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:07.070
don't harm the cute one that
I'm going to Hughug.

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:14.980
<i>Spirits are constantly flowing through nature.</i>

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:20.190
<i>People have such a foolish existence.</i>

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:25.420
<i>Walking through life without using
these abundant spirits.</i>

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:36.970
What?

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.840
The water is burning!

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:45.340
Lisa's Kigen Arts are so awesome!

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:46.820
Why?

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:49.350
<i>You don't get it?</i>

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.860
<i>You don't understand why your
buckets fell off balance?</i>

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:59.090
<i>The spiritual flows in the buckets of
water in each hand is different.</i>

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:02.830
<i>If you try and treat the two the same,
you will lose your balance.</i>

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.840
<i>The spiritual flow is different?</i>

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:07.810
<i>It is not just the water.</i>

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:09.710
<i>The spirits are constantly changing.</i>

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:14.270
<i>If you misread the flow,
the unthinkable will happen.</i>

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:18.280
<i>That is what true nature is, Lisa.</i>

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:20.920
You think you went a little overboard?

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:22.110
No kidding.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.690
You guys really are quite the misbehavers.

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:28.920
Lisa, you've got to put out this fire soon.

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:30.260
It's so hot!

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:32.920
I misread the flow of the spirits.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:35.770
I never thought the water would burn!

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:41.100
<i>Water in Wonderland has a high concentration
of the energy substance called Elenium.</i>

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:46.370
<i>Catherine takes that, and through a
remarkable system, uses it for propulsive power.</i>

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:48.540
The water in Wonderland!

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.120
So the Elenium in the water is burning
because of my Kigen Arts!?

00:14:56.190 --> 00:15:00.180
I used my Kigen Arts before I finished reading
the spirit of the water of Wonderland...

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:02.690
Ai!

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:12.910
Sis! Sis!

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:15.030
Say something! Sis!

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:18.740
What do we do?! She's not moving! Sis!

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:23.110
Don't worry. I won't let her down.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:28.310
Wake up, Sis!

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:30.690
Please, Ai, breathe!

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:34.320
Sis!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:40.460
Hey, Yu is calling you too!

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.530
Breathe!

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:47.300
You want to meet your father and
mother again, don't you?!

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:49.340
You're going to see them, aren't you?!

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:54.010
What would we do without you?!

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:57.610
We've got to all stick together!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:02.180
Families have got to stick together!
Don't do this!

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:09.990
They're back again, Lisa!

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.460
Lisa...

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:19.560
Kaze!

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:25.180
We've found the Magun baby!

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:32.690
It's not moving.

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:42.300
Lisa, Kaze was just... He was just eaten!

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:43.890
Come back. Come back to us.

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:49.130
They're coming closer and closer! Lisa! Lisa!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.870
Come back! Ai!

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:09.190
Spiritual energies of nature...

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:11.450
Please... Please...

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:14.750
Please...

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:17.560
Help this girl!

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:26.600
Sis!

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:27.570
Ai!

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:32.970
Ai!

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:36.610
Lisa!

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:38.320
Ai!

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:44.650
We've been surrounded!

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:47.420
Ai! Yu! Get behind me!

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:51.190
Lisa, they just ate Kaze!

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:55.830
I'll have to transform my life into
spirit energy to defeat them.

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:59.970
But what will happen to the kids, left all alone?

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:04.940
It has moved.

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:07.780
Soil is my power!

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:29.460
The appropriate Soil to use
against you has been decided!

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:36.440
Grinding up and eating rocks,
Shark Gray!

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.210
Mister?

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:48.050
The one that drinks up thirst,
Water Blue!

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:52.690
Kaze!

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:58.660
And finally, that which can even chew
on empty space, Crusher White!

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:13.140
What an amazing flow of spirits!

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:20.390
Roar! I summon you, Bismarck!

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:24.580
What?!

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:47.910
No way!

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:54.880
Wow!

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:59.460
There's nothing left at all.

00:19:59.560 --> 00:20:00.690
What about Kaze?

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:04.530
Lisa, thank you!

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:08.230
You were the one who saved me, right?

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:10.770
I'm just really glad that you're okay.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.600
I thought you were a goner, Sis!

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:17.800
I can't die that easily.

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:22.070
Yeah, you still have yet to meet
your parents, right?

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:23.340
Yeah!

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.820
But where is Kaze?

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:29.510
Something is shaking!

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.720
An earthquake?

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:33.620
Maybe the ground around here is loosening up.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:36.230
The ground has...

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:38.200
Collapsed!

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:39.390
We're...

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:44.030
Falling!

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.720
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.720
I am so thirsty

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.080
Taihen nan desu

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.080
It's really getting bad

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.210
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.210
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.560
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.560
My heart skipped a beat

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:05.460
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:05.460
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.130
Goumon no you desu

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.130
It's just like torture

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:08.560
Taekirenai desu

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:08.560
I can't take it

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:10.590
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:10.590
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.070
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.070
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:16.560
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:16.560
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.640
Douka kamisama

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.640
Please, God

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:24.950
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:24.950
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:28.480
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:28.480
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.110
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.110
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:34.120
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:34.120
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:37.120
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:37.120
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.960
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.960
You are now the only person

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:42.300
